### Quick Checklist Before Launch

- [ ] All pages are SSR/SSG and have meta tags.  
- [ ] Images are optimized (`next/image`).  
- [ ] Cart and checkout work offline (React Query cache).  
- [ ] Admin panel protected by role‑based auth.  
- [ ] Unit & E2E tests pass locally.  
- [ ] Lighthouse score ≥ 90 (performance, accessibility, SEO).  
- [ ] CI pipeline builds and deploys automatically.  
- [ ] Error monitoring (Sentry) is active.  

---

**Happy coding!**  
If you hit a specific roadblock—be it a component design, API integration, or deployment issue—just let me know and I can dive deeper into that part.
